{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 13, "model_name": "google/gemma-3n-e4b-it", "content": "Hark a traveler to the land of the rising sun a journey most grand and wondrously begun!\n\n**Day One: Arrival in Tokyo a Metropolis of Light**\n\nFrom distant shores thou shalt arrive at Narita's gate\nWhere bustling crowds do greet with eager state\nTo Shinjuku's heights thy carriage shall proceed\nA towering city a visionary deed\nCheck into thy lodgings a haven serene\nThen wander forth to gardens ever green\nExplore the Golden Gai a maze of delight\nAnd dine on ramen bathed in neon light.\n\n**Day Two: Tokyo's Temples and Imperial Grace**\n\nTo Asakusa's temple a journey swift and true\nWhere ancient spirits watch o'er me and you\nSenso-ji's grandeur a sight to behold\nWith incense smoke and stories to be told\nThen to the Imperial Palace a regal view\nWhere emperors once reigned in ages new\nGinza's bright shops a glittering display\nWhere silks and treasures beckon thee to stay.\n\n**Day Three: Hakone's Beauty and Volcanic Steam**\n\nHakone's mountains a vision fair and bold\nBy Lake Ashi's waters stories unfold\nA cruise thou shalt take a gentle glide\nPast Mount Fuji's peak in glorious pride\nVolcanic hot springs a soothing balm\nTo ease thy weary soul and keep it calm\nArt museums grace thy wandering eye\nBeneath a canvas of a boundless sky.\n\n**Day Four: Kyoto's Ancient Charm a Cultural Dream**\n\nBy bullet train to Kyoto thou shalt haste\nA city of temples a historical taste\nFushimi Inari's gates a vermillion hue\nA thousand torii paths for thee to view\nKiyomizu-dera's stage a wondrous sight\nWhere panoramic views fill thee with light\nGion's geishas a fleeting grace\nA whispered secret in this ancient place.\n\n**Day Five: Kyoto's Gardens and Golden Pavilion**\n\nRyoan-ji's garden a Zen delight\nFifteen stones arranged in shadowed light\nKinkaku-ji's gold a shimmering gleam\nReflecting beauty like a waking dream\nArashiyama's bamboo forest tall\nA verdant haven enchanting all\nNijo Castle's halls a shogun's keep\nWhere history slumbers in slumber deep.\n\n**Day Six: Nara's Deer and Todai-ji's Might**\n\nTo Nara thou shalt journey a joyful quest\nWhere friendly deer roam freely at their best\nTodai-ji's temple a giant's grace\nHousing Buddha's image in this sacred space\nKasuga Taisha's lanterns softly glow\nA path of wishes where prayers flow\nReturn to Kyoto with memories bright\nOf ancient wonders bathed in fading light.\n\n**Day Seven: Departure a Farewell to Japan**\n\nA final breakfast a bittersweet taste\nOf flavors savored time cannot erase\nTo Kansai Airport thy journey leads\nWhere parting thoughts plant hopeful seeds\nFarewell Japan a land of grace and art\nForever etched within thy grateful heart.\nGo forth and tell of wonders seen\nA journey most memorable and keen.\n", "logprobs": [{"token": "H", "logprob": -0.009764053858816624}, {"token": "ark", "logprob": -5.960462772236497e-07}, {"token": "▁a", "logprob": -0.6388339996337891}, {"token": "▁traveler", "logprob": -1.9362852573394775}, {"token": "▁to", "logprob": -0.2088422328233719}, {"token": "▁the", "logprob": -0.5565663576126099}, {"token": "▁land", "logprob": -0.7253383994102478}, {"token": "▁of", "logprob": -4.768370445162873e-07}, {"token": "▁the", "logprob": -0.12119961529970169}, {"token": "▁rising", "logprob": -0.1697479635477066}, {"token": "▁sun", "logprob": -0.0002454218047205359}, {"token": "▁a", "logprob": -0.36536312103271484}, {"token": "▁journey", "logprob": -0.13907566666603088}, {"token": "▁most", "logprob": -0.05123228579759598}, {"token": "▁grand", "logprob": -0.02602905035018921}, {"token": "▁and", "logprob": -2.7049994468688965}, {"token": "▁wondrous", "logprob": -0.4650764465332031}, {"token": "ly", "logprob": -2.302436590194702}, {"token": "▁begun", "logprob": -0.2388530820608139}, {"token": "!", "logprob": -0.4778808057308197}, {"token": "\n\n", "logprob": -0.013472940772771835}, {"token": "**", "logprob": -2.1